      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CATCH MY DESIGN (1) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 3 lengths at this track in a handy 19.62. Well suited by the inside box and likes the trip. Has good speed and is aided by the cherry draw. Will go close again if runs up to latest. LET'S ENJOY THIS (7) boasts a strong record this journey with nine wins and 12 minors from 22 tries. Comes off a (19.62) win last time, scoring by 2 lengths in a Other over 342m at this track. Can hit the frame with the right run. PARRAKIE (4) was below best at her last couple, the latest finishing seventh at this track, but was among the placings at Gawler three back. Safe beginner but tricky box to overcome. Key player on best and worth another try. OSPREY CHRONOS (2) is worth consideration after filling a hole last start.",
